an rpgmaker 2000 rpg based on arthur millars stage play "The Crucible"

to play, extract one of the .7z files in this repository and run the "RPG_RT.exe" file inside it.

yuoll need to install rpgmaker 2000 to play it, which is available to buy here: https://store.steampowered.com/app/383730/RPG_Maker_2000/

if anything goes wrong for yuo, pls leave a comment or something at: deviantart.com/DontCallMeTwinky
